# Screenshots / QA / capturas de debug na raiz do monorepo.
# Regra genérica: QUALQUER imagem solta na raiz é ignorada — screenshots de
# QA nunca pertencem ao repo. Assets legítimos vivem em subdirs (assets/,
# public/, examples/, etc.). Adicionar exceções aqui só se for mesmo necessário.
/*.png
/*.jpeg
/*.jpg
/*.gif
/*.webp
/*.bmp

# Agent tool artifacts
.sisyphus/
.playwright-mcp/

# Backup de .git antes de reescrita de histórico (BFG / filter-repo)
.git.bak-pre-bfg*/

# Cursor — estado local dos hooks (não versionar)
.cursor/hooks/

# Experiments — meshes de teste não pertencem ao repo
experiments/

# Estado local de schedulers de agentes
*.scheduled_tasks.lock
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# VibeGame simple-rpg — assets binários distribuídos via GitHub Release
# (scripts/fetch-assets.mjs + assets.lock.json). Não versionar para manter
# o histórico leve; restaurar localmente com: node scripts/fetch-assets.mjs
VibeGame/examples/simple-rpg/public/assets/meshes/**
VibeGame/examples/simple-rpg/public/assets/images/
VibeGame/examples/simple-rpg/public/assets/textures/
VibeGame/examples/simple-rpg/public/assets/icons/
VibeGame/examples/simple-rpg/public/assets/audio/
VibeGame/examples/simple-rpg/public/assets/sky/
VibeGame/examples/simple-rpg/public/assets/terrain/
VibeGame/examples/simple-rpg/public/assets/particles/
# Carpet bpy (scripts/generate_vegetation_glb.py) — pequeno, versionado
!VibeGame/examples/simple-rpg/public/assets/meshes/vegetation/
!VibeGame/examples/simple-rpg/public/assets/meshes/vegetation/**
# Manter a estrutura de pastas (.gitkeep) mesmo sem assets
!VibeGame/examples/simple-rpg/public/assets/**/.gitkeep
# Marker written by scripts/fetch-assets.mjs (prebuilt asset bundle version)
VibeGame/examples/simple-rpg/public/assets/.assets-version

# Screenshots de teste no exemplo
VibeGame/examples/simple-rpg/screenshot*.png

