VibeGame/examples/simple-racer/sample-gameassets/**/.gameassets_work/
VibeGame/examples/simple-racer/sample-gameassets/resume-*.jsonl
VibeGame/examples/simple-racer/sample-gameassets/resume-*.stdout
VibeGame/examples/simple-racer/node_modules/

